  "en": {
    "kind": "Music for the stage",
    "about": [
      "Xarchakos's music for Iakovos Kambanellis's stage show To megalo mas tsirko (1973), recorded with the cast: Jenny Karezi, Kostas Kazakos, Nikos Xylouris, Spyros Konstantopoulos and others. After the restoration of democracy Xarchakos wrote \"Proskynima\" for the production, to honour the victims of the Polytechnic uprising (Wikipedia)."
